  "notes": "しくしく primarily describes quiet crying/sobbing, but can also describe a mild persistent ache.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- めそめそ: weeping, crying weakly\n- えんえん: crying loudly\n- わんわん: bawling, crying loudly\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- しくしく泣く: to sob, to whimper\n- しくしく痛む: to have a dull ache",
